Spec: Java monotonic lease time fence

Purpose:
  Share effective UTC that cannot stall or move backward while monotonic time advances.

Owns:
  ./LeaseClock.java

Must:
  Preserve fractional monotonic milliseconds and forward wall-clock observations without extending signed expiry.
  Reject monotonic rollback permanently and share the fence throughout an Agent authority generation.
  Permit Android elapsed-realtime injection without Android framework dependencies in portable sources.
  Permit only forward authenticated server-Date observations from the pinned control client; never reset elapsed time, move a shared fence backward or extend an issued receipt.
  Advance conservatively by the HTTP Date quantization bound plus the complete measured request duration; a delayed response must not overestimate remaining signed validity.
